@startuml data-flow
!theme plain
title 入札案件審査システム - データフローシーケンス図\n3層アーキテクチャを通じた主要オペレーション

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #37474F
  LifeLineBorderColor #546E7A
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<presentation>> #E3F2FD
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<business>> #FFF3E0
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<data>> #E8F5E9
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<external>> #F3E5F5
  ParticipantBorderColor #546E7A
  GroupBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  DividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
}

' ==================================================================
' Participants
' ==================================================================

actor "利用者" as User

box "Presentation層 (Controller + View)" #E3F2FD
  participant "React SPA\n(App.tsx)" as FE <<presentation>>
  participant "authMiddleware" as AuthMW <<presentation>>
  participant "Express Router\n(index.ts)" as Router <<presentation>>
end box

box "Business Logic層 (Service)" #FFF3E0
  participant "EvaluationService" as EvalSvc <<business>>
  participant "AnnouncementService" as AnnSvc <<business>>
  participant "DocumentService" as DocSvc <<business>>
end box

box "Data Access層 (Repository)" #E8F5E9
  participant "EvaluationRepository" as EvalRepo <<data>>
  participant "AnnouncementRepository" as AnnRepo <<data>>
  participant "GCS Utility\n(utils/gcs.ts)" as GcsUtil <<data>>
end box

box "外部データストア" #F3E5F5
  database "PostgreSQL\n(Cloud SQL)" as DB <<external>>
  collections "Cloud Storage\n(GCS)" as GCS <<external>>
end box

' ==================================================================
' 1. 評価一覧取得 (GET /api/evaluations)
' ==================================================================
== 1. 評価一覧取得 (GET /api/evaluations) ==

User -> FE : BidListPage を表示
activate FE
FE -> AuthMW : GET /api/evaluations\n?page=0&pageSize=25&searchQuery=...
activate AuthMW
note right of AuthMW
  **認証チェック:**
  - API_KEY未設定: GET許可
  - API_KEY設定済: Bearer token検証
end note
AuthMW -> Router : 認証通過
deactivate AuthMW
activate Router

Router -> EvalSvc : **getList(filters)**
activate EvalSvc
note right of EvalSvc
  **Service層のビジネスロジック:**
  - page / pageSize のデフォルト値適用
  - filters の正規化
  (ステータス判定は SQL CASE で実行中)
end note

EvalSvc -> EvalRepo : **findWithFilters(filters)**
activate EvalRepo
note right of EvalRepo
  **Repository層 (SQLはここだけ):**
  - buildWhereClause() でフィルタ条件構築
  - COUNT(*) で total 取得
  - company_bid_judgement JOIN bid_announcements
    JOIN company_master LEFT JOIN office_master
    LEFT JOIN evaluation_statuses
  - LIMIT / OFFSET でページネーション
end note

EvalRepo -> DB : **Promise.all([\n  pool.query(SELECT COUNT(*) ...),\n  pool.query(SELECT ... FROM company_bid_judgement\n    JOIN bid_announcements ...\n    WHERE ... LIMIT $n OFFSET $m)\n])**
activate DB
note right of DB
  COUNT + DATA クエリを
  別コネクションで並列実行
  JOIN条件は数値比較（::text除去済）
end note
DB --> EvalRepo : [countResult, dataResult]
deactivate DB

EvalRepo --> EvalSvc : { data: rows[], total }
deactivate EvalRepo

EvalSvc --> Router : PaginatedResponse<EvaluationListItem>\n{ data, total, page, pageSize }
deactivate EvalSvc

Router --> FE : 200 JSON response
deactivate Router

FE --> User : 評価一覧テーブル描画
deactivate FE

' ==================================================================
' 2. 評価詳細取得 with GCS enrichment (GET /api/evaluations/:id)
' ==================================================================
== 2. 評価詳細取得 + GCSドキュメント付与 (GET /api/evaluations/:id) ==

User -> FE : BidDetailPage へ遷移
activate FE
FE -> AuthMW : GET /api/evaluations/12345
activate AuthMW
AuthMW -> Router : 認証通過
deactivate AuthMW
activate Router

Router -> EvalSvc : **getById("12345")**
activate EvalSvc

EvalSvc -> EvalRepo : **findById("12345")**
activate EvalRepo
note right of EvalRepo
  **Repository層 (SQLはここだけ):**
  - WITH documents, competing_companies,
    step_assignees, requirement_details
  - 複数テーブルを CTE + LEFT JOIN で結合
  - documents に markdown_path を含む
end note

EvalRepo -> DB : SELECT ... WITH documents AS (...)\nWHERE evaluation_no = $1::integer
activate DB
DB --> EvalRepo : evaluation row\n(announcement.documents に markdown_path あり)
deactivate DB

EvalRepo --> EvalSvc : evaluation object
deactivate EvalRepo

note right of EvalSvc #FFFDE7
  **Service層のビジネスロジック:**
  evaluation.announcement.documents が存在する場合
  DocumentService でGCSコンテンツを付与
end note

EvalSvc -> DocSvc : **attachDocumentContents(documents[])**
activate DocSvc

note right of DocSvc #FFFDE7
  **DocumentService のビジネスロジック:**
  1. documents[] から gs:// パスを抽出
  2. gcsPaths[] と gcsIndexMap[] を構築
  3. readMultipleMarkdownFromGCS() で並列取得
  4. content を付与、markdown_path を除去
  5. 失敗時: "文字起こしデータがありません"
end note

DocSvc -> GcsUtil : **readMultipleMarkdownFromGCS(gcsPaths[], fallback)**
activate GcsUtil

GcsUtil -> GCS : **Promise.all([\n  storage.bucket(b).file(f1).download(),\n  storage.bucket(b).file(f2).download(),\n  ...\n])**
activate GCS
note right of GCS
  各ファイルを並列ダウンロード
  (Excel/PDF の OCR 解析結果 Markdown)
end note
GCS --> GcsUtil : Buffer[] (UTF-8 markdown)
deactivate GCS

GcsUtil --> DocSvc : string[] (markdown contents)
deactivate GcsUtil

DocSvc --> EvalSvc : documents[] with content populated
deactivate DocSvc

EvalSvc --> Router : evaluation (documents に content 付き)
deactivate EvalSvc

Router --> FE : 200 JSON response
deactivate Router

FE --> User : 評価詳細画面 + ドキュメント内容表示
deactivate FE

' ==================================================================
' 3. 公告ステータス判定 (GET /api/announcements)
' ==================================================================
== 3. 公告一覧 + ステータス判定 (GET /api/announcements) ==

User -> FE : AnnouncementListPage を表示
activate FE
FE -> AuthMW : GET /api/announcements\n?page=0&pageSize=25
activate AuthMW
AuthMW -> Router : 認証通過
deactivate AuthMW
activate Router

Router -> AnnSvc : **getList(filters)**
activate AnnSvc
note right of AnnSvc #FFFDE7
  **Service層のビジネスロジック:**
  - page / pageSize のデフォルト値適用
  - (ステータス判定ロジック定義あり)
  **determineAnnouncementStatus(bidEndDate):**
    - 日付なし/無効 -> "closed"
    - end >= now+14日 -> "upcoming" (公告中)
    - end >= now     -> "ongoing" (締切間近)
    - end < now      -> "awaiting_result" (結果待)
  **normalizeBidType(bidType):**
    - NULL/空 -> "unknown"
end note

AnnSvc -> AnnRepo : **findWithFilters(filters)**
activate AnnRepo
note right of AnnRepo
  **Repository層 (SQLはここだけ):**
  - buildWhereClause() でフィルタ条件構築
  - COUNT(*) で total 取得
  - bid_announcements テーブルから SELECT
  - bidType は COALESCE(..., 'unknown')
  - ページネーション (LIMIT / OFFSET)
end note

AnnRepo -> DB : **Promise.all([\n  pool.query(SELECT COUNT(*) ...),\n  pool.query(SELECT ... FROM bid_announcements\n    WHERE ... LIMIT $n OFFSET $m)\n])**
activate DB
note right of DB
  COUNT + DATA クエリを並列実行
end note
DB --> AnnRepo : [countResult, dataResult]
deactivate DB

AnnRepo --> AnnSvc : { data: rows[], total }
deactivate AnnRepo

AnnSvc --> Router : PaginatedResponse<AnnouncementListItem>\n{ data, total, page, pageSize }
deactivate AnnSvc

Router --> FE : 200 JSON response
deactivate Router

FE --> User : 公告一覧テーブル描画
deactivate FE

' ==================================================================
' 4. ワークステータス更新 (PATCH /api/evaluations/:evaluationNo)
' ==================================================================
== 4. ワークステータス更新 (PATCH /api/evaluations/:evaluationNo) ==

User -> FE : ステータスを変更\n(例: "in_progress" -> "completed")
activate FE
FE -> AuthMW : PATCH /api/evaluations/12345\n{ "workStatus": "completed",\n  "currentStep": "final_review" }
activate AuthMW
note right of AuthMW
  **書込み操作:**
  API_KEY必須 (Bearer token検証)
  未設定時は 403 で拒否
end note
AuthMW -> Router : 認証通過
deactivate AuthMW
activate Router

Router -> EvalSvc : **updateWorkStatus("12345", "completed", "final_review")**
activate EvalSvc

note right of EvalSvc #FFFDE7
  **Service層のビジネスロジック (バリデーション):**
  1. **validateWorkStatus("completed")**
     許可値: not_started | in_progress
     | completed | on_hold | cancelled
  2. **validateCurrentStep("final_review")**
     許可値: judgment | document_review
     | field_survey | final_review
  3. 不正値の場合は Error をスロー
end note

EvalSvc -> EvalRepo : **updateWorkStatus("12345", "completed", "final_review")**
activate EvalRepo
note right of EvalRepo
  **Repository層 (SQLはここだけ):**
  - INSERT INTO evaluation_statuses
    ON CONFLICT ("evaluationNo") DO UPDATE
  - workStatus と currentStep を更新
  - updatedAt = NOW()
  - RETURNING で更新後の行を返却
end note

EvalRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO evaluation_statuses\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3)\nON CONFLICT DO UPDATE\nRETURNING ...
activate DB
DB --> EvalRepo : updated row
deactivate DB

EvalRepo --> EvalSvc : { evaluationNo, workStatus,\n  currentStep, updatedAt }
deactivate EvalRepo

EvalSvc --> Router : updated evaluation status
deactivate EvalSvc

Router --> FE : 200 JSON response
deactivate Router

FE --> User : ステータス変更を画面に反映
deactivate FE

' ==================================================================
' 5. 公告詳細 + GCS ドキュメント (GET /api/announcements/:no)
' ==================================================================
== 5. 公告詳細 + GCSドキュメント付与 (GET /api/announcements/:no) ==

User -> FE : AnnouncementDetailPage へ遷移
activate FE
FE -> AuthMW : GET /api/announcements/678
activate AuthMW
AuthMW -> Router : 認証通過
deactivate AuthMW
activate Router

Router -> AnnSvc : **getByNo(678)**
activate AnnSvc

AnnSvc -> AnnRepo : **findByNo(678)**
activate AnnRepo
note right of AnnRepo
  **Repository層 (SQLはここだけ):**
  - WITH documents_agg, competing_companies_agg
  - bid_announcements LEFT JOIN documents_agg
    LEFT JOIN competing_companies_agg
  - documents に markdown_path を含む
end note

AnnRepo -> DB : SELECT ... WITH documents_agg AS (...)\nWHERE announcement_no = $1
activate DB
DB --> AnnRepo : announcement row
deactivate DB

AnnRepo --> AnnSvc : announcement object
deactivate AnnRepo

note right of AnnSvc #FFFDE7
  **Service層:**
  documents 配列が存在する場合
  DocumentService で GCS コンテンツを付与
end note

AnnSvc -> DocSvc : **attachDocumentContents(documents[])**
activate DocSvc

DocSvc -> GcsUtil : **readMultipleMarkdownFromGCS(gcsPaths[], fallback)**
activate GcsUtil

GcsUtil -> GCS : **Promise.all([ file.download(), ... ])**
activate GCS
GCS --> GcsUtil : markdown contents[]
deactivate GCS

GcsUtil --> DocSvc : string[]
deactivate GcsUtil

DocSvc --> AnnSvc : documents[] with content
deactivate DocSvc

AnnSvc --> Router : announcement (documents に content 付き)
deactivate AnnSvc

Router --> FE : 200 JSON response
deactivate Router

FE --> User : 公告詳細画面 + ドキュメント内容表示
deactivate FE

' ==================================================================
' Legend / Notes
' ==================================================================

note across #ECEFF1
  **3層アーキテクチャの原則**
  | 層 | 責務 | SQL | ビジネスロジック | GCS アクセス |
  | Presentation (Controller) | ルーティング・レスポンス整形 | NG | NG | NG |
  | Business Logic (Service) | バリデーション・ステータス判定・データ変換 | NG | OK (ここだけ) | DocumentService経由 |
  | Data Access (Repository + GCS Util) | データ取得・保存 | OK (ここだけ) | NG | OK (ここだけ) |
end note

@enduml
